            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.01em] text-neutral-900 group-hover:text-violet-700">Why a UAE e-invoicing readiness deck fails the week after you deliver it.</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-700">A readiness deck tells you what might be wrong on the day it was written. Your data keeps changing after that, so the deck is stale within a week.</p>
